PORTIONS DERIVED FROM VISUAL6502 (MIT)

The switch-level solver, the 6502 clock and bus layer, the timing-state
reconstruction and the signal name table in this repository are a Rust port of
the corresponding JavaScript in visual6502 (`chipsim.js`, `wires.js`,
`macros.js`, `nodenames.js`), which is MIT licensed:

    Copyright (c) 2010 Brian Silverman, Barry Silverman, Ed Spittles,
